        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Paper, woodfree, uncoated, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Paper, woodfree, uncoated, at regional storage
na;
UUID: d35eab11-6698-324a-8e46-21f9ebb69c06
This module includes the transport from the production site to a central distribution site within Switzerland for the domestic and the foreign uncoated fine paper consumed in Switzerland.; Geography: Deliveries within/to Switzerland according to official Swiss trade statistics with country-specific transport distances.
Location:  Deliveries within/to Switzerland according to official Swiss trade statistics with country-specific transport distances.
Technology: Average situation
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: Total Swiss graphic paper consumption 2000: 725.8 kt (official statistics)
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: Standard distances for domestic production, imports from neighbourhood countries and imports from scandinavian countries. Distribution integrated / non-integrated mill based on own assumption.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d35eab11-6698-324a-8e46-21f9ebb69c06.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
